    Business e-waste covers everything between a home pickup and a full corporate ITAD engagement — small offices, single-location retail stores, restaurants, hospitality operators, clinics, professional practices, workshops, and mid-size services companies. This page is the entry point for businesses that need slightly more than a routine consumer pickup — GST invoicing, data destruction for computers and phones, formal disposal records for accounts — but don't have the compliance overhead of a listed enterprise or the scale that justifies a full ITAD engagement. It covers what documentation is standard, how business pickup is scheduled around operating hours, and where the workflow shades into corporate ITAD when scope grows.
  </p>

